{"id": "3263992", "revid": "168447", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3263992", "title": "Huperzia", "text": "Huperzia este un gen din familia Lycopodiaceae, clasa Lycopodiopsida. Acest gen a fost ini\u021bial inclus \u00een genul \u00eenrudit \"Lycopodium\", de care difer\u0103 prin faptul c\u0103 are frunze sporangiale nediferen\u021biate, iar sporangii nu sunt forma\u021bi \u00een conuri apicale.\nSpecii.\n\u00cen Rom\u00e2nia vegeteaz\u0103 specia \"Huperzia selago\"."}
{"id": "3263993", "revid": "168447", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3263993", "title": "Diphasiastrum", "text": "Diphasiastrum este un gen din familia Lycopodiaceae, clasa Lycopodiopsida. Este \u00eenrudit cu genul \"Lycopodium\".\nSpecii.\n\u00cen Rom\u00e2nia vegeteaz\u0103 c\u00e2teva specii, cele mai importante fiind \"Diphasiastrum alpinum\" (sin. \"Lycopodium alpinum\", br\u0103di\u0219or), \"Diphasiastrum complanatum\" (sin. \"Lycopodium complanatum\", \u0219erpu\u0219or) \u0219i \"Diphasiastrum tristachyum\" (sin. \"Lycopodium tristachyum\", br\u0103di\u0219or)."}
